  "core_text": "我爸妈说了，结婚彩礼一口价，六十八万，市中心新房必须加上我的名字，少一样，这婚就结不成。姑娘，这这我们老两口一辈子攒的积蓄，撑死了，也就够个首付。彩礼能不能少点儿？给你们两个孩子留点过日子的钱，留着过日子。陈梦，没钱就别冲大头，娶媳妇儿，六十八万都拿不出来。你们家是打算空手套狼狼呢？真穷穷的可可唐伟，这是商量结婚不是做买卖，你非要在长辈面前这么逼人吗？商量没这个家底就别耽误我这婚谁爱结谁结，我先寒碜。小莫妈是不是做错事了？我听说了，真因为彩礼房子的事儿分了，张口就要六十八万加新房，把感情当买卖算账，谈下去也是灾难彻底分了分的好，三观不正走不远。我有个大学同学叫苏晴人，特别明事理，性格极其温和，介绍你俩认识一下算了。我现在真没心思应付相亲，就当普通朋友吃个工作餐，聊得来就处聊，不来多个人脉去见一面。你好，沉默，路上有点堵，没耽误你时间吧。没有，我也刚到，我看他们家菜量挺扎实的，我们两个人点两菜一汤就差不多了别浪费。等会儿要是不够，咱们再加澳洲和牛葱烧海参全点上出来吃饭，讲究的就是排场点，少了发朋友圈我都嫌丢人。怎么了？是有什么忌口吗？没有，这样点特别好。我能问个比较现实的问题吗？你对男方的彩礼和买房有什么硬性门槛吗？人品端正，有份踏实的工作能养活自己，没有不良债务。至于房子车子有，当然是加分项，没有，就两个人一起努力，攒钱付首付，普通人不都是这么一步一步过来的吗？就这么简单。这可不简单，踏实有担当，比现成的东西难找多了。不过我自己的原则也不低，比如遇事多沟通不翻旧账。最关键的是，结婚以后，咱们是独立经营的小家庭，大事小情，两个人商量着拿主意，互为第一顺位，绝不能无原则的当传声筒。车开了挺多年了，有点旧别见怪。车就是个遮风挡雨的代步工具。底盘扎实，开着顺手比什么都重要。不过沉默你右边这个雨刮胶条好像老化翘起来了。这两天天气预报说有暴雨，记得下班顺路花几十块换一副雨天，视线不好，开车，太危险了，天开个破车接我停在我们公司楼下，我都嫌丢人。你到底什么时候换奔驰啊？不是提前说了，人来就行，不用破费吗？第一次登门拜访阿姨空着手多失礼，挑了点，您平时用得上的。你看我们家这条件普通，家里也没什么贵重东西招待你阿姨心里总觉得委屈了你。阿姨，您快别这么说，陈默常跟我提起您勤劳踏实。我今天一进门就觉得特别亲切温馨，一家人踏实过日子，比什么虚荣，排场都珍贵。小苏啊，阿姨也是直性子，现在外头结婚，动不动就要大几十万彩礼全款大平层。你看我们家这条件，你家里要是要求高，我真怕拖了沉默后腿。阿姨彩礼是对女方家庭的一份尊重，但绝不是拿来明码标价的买卖。两个踏实过日子的人，最重要的不是县城。有多少家底，而是两个人能不能同心协力，只要沉默有担当，心疼人，我们两个人一起打拼，攒的首付住起来比谁给的都踏实。日子是过给自己的，只要新奇，别人有的，我们迟早都会有听见。没有儿子遇到小苏，是咱们家天大的福气，还是那个客厅，还是那份拘谨，可换了一个知书达理的人，压在母亲心头大半年的石头终于被彻底放下了也不知道你爱吃什么，阿姨就随便做了几个菜，阿姨这还叫随便做啊。这么一大桌子。我刚进门就闻到香味儿了，你尝尝这个。不过阿姨不太会做饭，做的肯定没有你妈妈做的好吃。阿姨，这还真没法比，我妈做的是我从小吃到大的家的味道。您今天这一桌是知道我要来特意准备的心意，一个是家的味道，一个是您的心意，这哪能放在一起比啊。你这姑娘还挺会说话，不过阿姨，您可别再给我夹菜了，怎么不好吃？哪能啊？我是怕第一次来就吃三碗米，下次您听说我要来还得提前多买两斤米，还吃是福，多吃点儿小苏啊。阿姨随口问问，你别多心，以后要是你跟陈默真组了，家庭在你们家谁说了算啊？阿姨真成家了，大事，我肯定多听。沉默的陈梦在外面有担当，眼光宽大，方向，她把关，我放心，平时柴米油盐，人情往来的琐事就由我来操心，省得她分心。但其实，不管表面听谁的，只要心往一处使，把日子过敞亮了，谁当家不都一样吗？那阿姨再问你最后一个，要是以后我和你之间有了分歧矛盾，你希望沉默帮谁？妈，哪有第一次来家里问这个的阿姨，真要是有不同意见，那肯定得是沉默先帮着您啊。您是长辈几十年的生活阅历在那儿真有分歧，多半是我年轻考虑的不够周全。再说了，沉默要是连生，他养他的亲妈都不护着我，哪敢把自己的后半辈子放心交给他呀。哎呀，这姑娘真是心善，懂事儿的，让人心疼沉默。你听听人家这格局，以后，你要是敢欺负小苏，我第一个饶不了，你快放下，快放下。第一次来是贵客，哪能让你洗碗。那行，阿姨，今天第一趟来，我绝对服从长辈安排，今天我负责常阿姨的大餐。等以后，我和陈默长回来了，厨房里的油烟杂活全都交给我们俩您啊，就踏踏实实坐沙发上看电视享清福。哈哈哈呵好有你这句话，阿姨心里比吃了蜜还甜啊。以后每个周末都跟陈默回来，阿姨随时给你做爱吃的。我现在是真服你了，怎么啦？我妈一进门提到彩礼和房子，一句话就把他说高兴了。吃饭的时候，他说做饭没，你妈妈好吃，换成我，我都不知道怎么接。后面又问你结婚以后谁说了算，还问他跟你闹矛盾了，我应该帮谁？我坐旁边听着都替你紧张，你到底是怎么练的？为什么别人突然给你一句话，你马上就知道该怎么接？其实我以前跟你一样，不爱说话，也不知道怎么组织语言，一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处。它里面就是一个场景，一个场景的告诉你，遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。比如别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说，辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下无弱兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？难怪你每次都能接的这么快，这种东西不是天生的，就是平时一个场景，个场景的，看一个场景，一个场景的练。每天看两页，慢慢积累一些不同场景之下，应该怎么说？这里面还有很多生活里的场景，比如对象给你发红包，你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣，同事向你借钱，你又不想借，可以回，大家都是一样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，你可以回随便想，千万别跟我客气，目前不收费。嗯，哈呵这个有意思，我第一次读到这些的时候，也有种豁然开朗的感觉。这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，一个一个拆开给你看，别人怎么说，你可以怎么接，都是一句一句给你举例。所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，每天不用看很多看两页，碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，你就知道怎么接了。这本先借，我看看拿去吧，回去慢慢看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00001",
      "start_ms": 390,
      "end_ms": 1330,
      "text": "我爸妈说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2210,
      "end_ms": 3510,
      "text": "结婚彩礼一口价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3510,
      "end_ms": 4190,
      "text": "六十八万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5090,
      "end_ms": 7790,
      "text": "市中心新房必须加上我的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8310,
      "end_ms": 8890,
      "text": "少一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8890,
      "end_ms": 9870,
      "text": "这婚就结不成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10650,
      "end_ms": 11070,
      "text": "姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11410,
      "end_ms": 14370,
      "text": "这这我们老两口一辈子攒的积蓄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14630,
      "end_ms": 15150,
      "text": "撑死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15150,
      "end_ms": 15990,
      "text": "也就够个首付。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16330,
      "end_ms": 17930,
      "text": "彩礼能不能少点儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00012",
      "start_ms": 17930,
      "end_ms": 21290,
      "text": "给你们两个孩子留点过日子的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21290,
      "end_ms": 22970,
      "text": "留着过日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00014",
      "start_ms": 22970,
      "end_ms": 23450,
      "text": "陈梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00015",
      "start_ms": 23450,
      "end_ms": 24550,
      "text": "没钱就别冲大头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00016",
      "start_ms": 24550,
      "end_ms": 25210,
      "text": "娶媳妇儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00017",
      "start_ms": 25210,
      "end_ms": 26570,
      "text": "六十八万都拿不出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00018",
      "start_ms": 26570,
      "end_ms": 28550,
      "text": "你们家是打算空手套狼狼呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00019",
      "start_ms": 28550,
      "end_ms": 30560,
      "text": "真穷穷的可可唐伟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00020",
      "start_ms": 31320,
      "end_ms": 33300,
      "text": "这是商量结婚不是做买卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00021",
      "start_ms": 33380,
      "end_ms": 35080,
      "text": "你非要在长辈面前这么逼人吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00022",
      "start_ms": 35140,
      "end_ms": 39000,
      "text": "商量没这个家底就别耽误我这婚谁爱结谁结，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00023",
      "start_ms": 39320,
      "end_ms": 40195,
      "text": "我先寒碜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00024",
      "start_ms": 47020,
      "end_ms": 50185,
      "text": "小莫妈是不是做错事了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00025",
      "start_ms": 53710,
      "end_ms": 54370,
      "text": "我听说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00026",
      "start_ms": 54710,
      "end_ms": 56405,
      "text": "真因为彩礼房子的事儿分了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00027",
      "start_ms": 58570,
      "end_ms": 60515,
      "text": "张口就要六十八万加新房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00028",
      "start_ms": 61230,
      "end_ms": 62715,
      "text": "把感情当买卖算账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00029",
      "start_ms": 63280,
      "end_ms": 66835,
      "text": "谈下去也是灾难彻底分了分的好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00030",
      "start_ms": 67300,
      "end_ms": 68405,
      "text": "三观不正走不远。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00031",
      "start_ms": 68860,
      "end_ms": 70760,
      "text": "我有个大学同学叫苏晴人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70760,
      "end_ms": 71500,
      "text": "特别明事理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00033",
      "start_ms": 71560,
      "end_ms": 72625,
      "text": "性格极其温和，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00034",
      "start_ms": 72890,
      "end_ms": 75695,
      "text": "介绍你俩认识一下算了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00035",
      "start_ms": 76230,
      "end_ms": 77825,
      "text": "我现在真没心思应付相亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00036",
      "start_ms": 78230,
      "end_ms": 79825,
      "text": "就当普通朋友吃个工作餐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00037",
      "start_ms": 80210,
      "end_ms": 81250,
      "text": "聊得来就处聊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00038",
      "start_ms": 81250,
      "end_ms": 82655,
      "text": "不来多个人脉去见一面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00039",
      "start_ms": 90730,
      "end_ms": 91010,
      "text": "你好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00040",
      "start_ms": 91010,
      "end_ms": 91495,
      "text": "沉默，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00041",
      "start_ms": 92150,
      "end_ms": 92990,
      "text": "路上有点堵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00042",
      "start_ms": 93050,
      "end_ms": 93995,
      "text": "没耽误你时间吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00043",
      "start_ms": 94390,
      "end_ms": 94770,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00044",
      "start_ms": 95130,
      "end_ms": 95755,
      "text": "我也刚到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00045",
      "start_ms": 96440,
      "end_ms": 98120,
      "text": "我看他们家菜量挺扎实的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00046",
      "start_ms": 98180,
      "end_ms": 100540,
      "text": "我们两个人点两菜一汤就差不多了别浪费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00047",
      "start_ms": 100720,
      "end_ms": 101740,
      "text": "等会儿要是不够，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00048",
      "start_ms": 101740,
      "end_ms": 108220,
      "text": "咱们再加澳洲和牛葱烧海参全点上出来吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00049",
      "start_ms": 108480,
      "end_ms": 110280,
      "text": "讲究的就是排场点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00050",
      "start_ms": 110280,
      "end_ms": 111815,
      "text": "少了发朋友圈我都嫌丢人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00051",
      "start_ms": 112680,
      "end_ms": 113235,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00052",
      "start_ms": 113830,
      "end_ms": 114935,
      "text": "是有什么忌口吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00053",
      "start_ms": 115980,
      "end_ms": 116405,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00054",
      "start_ms": 116750,
      "end_ms": 117655,
      "text": "这样点特别好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00055",
      "start_ms": 119440,
      "end_ms": 120945,
      "text": "我能问个比较现实的问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00056",
      "start_ms": 121270,
      "end_ms": 124050,
      "text": "你对男方的彩礼和买房有什么硬性门槛吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00057",
      "start_ms": 124150,
      "end_ms": 124930,
      "text": "人品端正，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00058",
      "start_ms": 125130,
      "end_ms": 126950,
      "text": "有份踏实的工作能养活自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00059",
      "start_ms": 127010,
      "end_ms": 128025,
      "text": "没有不良债务。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00060",
      "start_ms": 128410,
      "end_ms": 130150,
      "text": "至于房子车子有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00061",
      "start_ms": 130150,
      "end_ms": 131085,
      "text": "当然是加分项，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00062",
      "start_ms": 131550,
      "end_ms": 131950,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00063",
      "start_ms": 132010,
      "end_ms": 133070,
      "text": "就两个人一起努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00064",
      "start_ms": 133070,
      "end_ms": 134045,
      "text": "攒钱付首付，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00065",
      "start_ms": 134450,
      "end_ms": 136745,
      "text": "普通人不都是这么一步一步过来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00066",
      "start_ms": 138200,
      "end_ms": 138960,
      "text": "就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00067",
      "start_ms": 139280,
      "end_ms": 140205,
      "text": "这可不简单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00068",
      "start_ms": 140660,
      "end_ms": 141560,
      "text": "踏实有担当，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00069",
      "start_ms": 141640,
      "end_ms": 143255,
      "text": "比现成的东西难找多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00070",
      "start_ms": 143690,
      "end_ms": 145615,
      "text": "不过我自己的原则也不低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00071",
      "start_ms": 146190,
      "end_ms": 148515,
      "text": "比如遇事多沟通不翻旧账。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00072",
      "start_ms": 148860,
      "end_ms": 149720,
      "text": "最关键的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00073",
      "start_ms": 149740,
      "end_ms": 150440,
      "text": "结婚以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00074",
      "start_ms": 150440,
      "end_ms": 152055,
      "text": "咱们是独立经营的小家庭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00075",
      "start_ms": 152380,
      "end_ms": 152980,
      "text": "大事小情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00076",
      "start_ms": 152980,
      "end_ms": 154360,
      "text": "两个人商量着拿主意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00077",
      "start_ms": 154500,
      "end_ms": 155565,
      "text": "互为第一顺位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00078",
      "start_ms": 155870,
      "end_ms": 157865,
      "text": "绝不能无原则的当传声筒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00079",
      "start_ms": 159700,
      "end_ms": 160860,
      "text": "车开了挺多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00080",
      "start_ms": 160880,
      "end_ms": 162365,
      "text": "有点旧别见怪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00081",
      "start_ms": 163230,
      "end_ms": 165295,
      "text": "车就是个遮风挡雨的代步工具。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00082",
      "start_ms": 166120,
      "end_ms": 166980,
      "text": "底盘扎实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00083",
      "start_ms": 166980,
      "end_ms": 168565,
      "text": "开着顺手比什么都重要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00084",
      "start_ms": 173010,
      "end_ms": 177085,
      "text": "不过沉默你右边这个雨刮胶条好像老化翘起来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00085",
      "start_ms": 177540,
      "end_ms": 179300,
      "text": "这两天天气预报说有暴雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00086",
      "start_ms": 179440,
      "end_ms": 182010,
      "text": "记得下班顺路花几十块换一副雨天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00087",
      "start_ms": 182010,
      "end_ms": 182590,
      "text": "视线不好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00088",
      "start_ms": 182590,
      "end_ms": 182890,
      "text": "开车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00089",
      "start_ms": 182890,
      "end_ms": 183675,
      "text": "太危险了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00090",
      "start_ms": 186530,
      "end_ms": 189090,
      "text": "天开个破车接我停在我们公司楼下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00091",
      "start_ms": 189090,
      "end_ms": 189835,
      "text": "我都嫌丢人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00092",
      "start_ms": 190160,
      "end_ms": 191725,
      "text": "你到底什么时候换奔驰啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00093",
      "start_ms": 197010,
      "end_ms": 197870,
      "text": "不是提前说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00094",
      "start_ms": 197870,
      "end_ms": 198530,
      "text": "人来就行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00095",
      "start_ms": 198530,
      "end_ms": 199415,
      "text": "不用破费吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00096",
      "start_ms": 199810,
      "end_ms": 202825,
      "text": "第一次登门拜访阿姨空着手多失礼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00097",
      "start_ms": 203180,
      "end_ms": 203580,
      "text": "挑了点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00098",
      "start_ms": 203580,
      "end_ms": 204735,
      "text": "您平时用得上的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00099",
      "start_ms": 205210,
      "end_ms": 206675,
      "text": "你看我们家这条件普通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00100",
      "start_ms": 207010,
      "end_ms": 210915,
      "text": "家里也没什么贵重东西招待你阿姨心里总觉得委屈了你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00101",
      "start_ms": 211170,
      "end_ms": 211625,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00102",
      "start_ms": 212000,
      "end_ms": 213155,
      "text": "您快别这么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00103",
      "start_ms": 213650,
      "end_ms": 215815,
      "text": "陈默常跟我提起您勤劳踏实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00104",
      "start_ms": 216200,
      "end_ms": 218535,
      "text": "我今天一进门就觉得特别亲切温馨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00105",
      "start_ms": 219290,
      "end_ms": 220855,
      "text": "一家人踏实过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00106",
      "start_ms": 221180,
      "end_ms": 221880,
      "text": "比什么虚荣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00107",
      "start_ms": 221880,
      "end_ms": 222955,
      "text": "排场都珍贵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00108",
      "start_ms": 223330,
      "end_ms": 223965,
      "text": "小苏啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00109",
      "start_ms": 224440,
      "end_ms": 225625,
      "text": "阿姨也是直性子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00110",
      "start_ms": 226030,
      "end_ms": 227010,
      "text": "现在外头结婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00111",
      "start_ms": 227110,
      "end_ms": 229735,
      "text": "动不动就要大几十万彩礼全款大平层。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00112",
      "start_ms": 230310,
      "end_ms": 231435,
      "text": "你看我们家这条件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00113",
      "start_ms": 231690,
      "end_ms": 232870,
      "text": "你家里要是要求高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00114",
      "start_ms": 232990,
      "end_ms": 234505,
      "text": "我真怕拖了沉默后腿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00115",
      "start_ms": 235140,
      "end_ms": 237775,
      "text": "阿姨彩礼是对女方家庭的一份尊重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00116",
      "start_ms": 238070,
      "end_ms": 239785,
      "text": "但绝不是拿来明码标价的买卖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00117",
      "start_ms": 240120,
      "end_ms": 241280,
      "text": "两个踏实过日子的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00118",
      "start_ms": 241300,
      "end_ms": 242320,
      "text": "最重要的不是县城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00119",
      "start_ms": 242320,
      "end_ms": 243125,
      "text": "有多少家底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00120",
      "start_ms": 243360,
      "end_ms": 245120,
      "text": "而是两个人能不能同心协力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00121",
      "start_ms": 245220,
      "end_ms": 246360,
      "text": "只要沉默有担当，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00122",
      "start_ms": 246400,
      "end_ms": 246960,
      "text": "心疼人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00123",
      "start_ms": 247220,
      "end_ms": 248340,
      "text": "我们两个人一起打拼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00124",
      "start_ms": 248340,
      "end_ms": 250815,
      "text": "攒的首付住起来比谁给的都踏实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00125",
      "start_ms": 251130,
      "end_ms": 252395,
      "text": "日子是过给自己的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00126",
      "start_ms": 252610,
      "end_ms": 253310,
      "text": "只要新奇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00127",
      "start_ms": 253490,
      "end_ms": 254190,
      "text": "别人有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00128",
      "start_ms": 254250,
      "end_ms": 256190,
      "text": "我们迟早都会有听见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00129",
      "start_ms": 256190,
      "end_ms": 258380,
      "text": "没有儿子遇到小苏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00130",
      "start_ms": 258380,
      "end_ms": 260015,
      "text": "是咱们家天大的福气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00131",
      "start_ms": 261090,
      "end_ms": 262135,
      "text": "还是那个客厅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00132",
      "start_ms": 262640,
      "end_ms": 263625,
      "text": "还是那份拘谨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00133",
      "start_ms": 264260,
      "end_ms": 265905,
      "text": "可换了一个知书达理的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00134",
      "start_ms": 266410,
      "end_ms": 274020,
      "text": "压在母亲心头大半年的石头终于被彻底放下了也不知道你爱吃什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00135",
      "start_ms": 274180,
      "end_ms": 275780,
      "text": "阿姨就随便做了几个菜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00136",
      "start_ms": 276020,
      "end_ms": 278205,
      "text": "阿姨这还叫随便做啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00137",
      "start_ms": 278520,
      "end_ms": 279440,
      "text": "这么一大桌子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00138",
      "start_ms": 279440,
      "end_ms": 280980,
      "text": "我刚进门就闻到香味儿了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00139",
      "start_ms": 282260,
      "end_ms": 283205,
      "text": "你尝尝这个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00140",
      "start_ms": 283850,
      "end_ms": 285290,
      "text": "不过阿姨不太会做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00141",
      "start_ms": 285510,
      "end_ms": 287585,
      "text": "做的肯定没有你妈妈做的好吃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00142",
      "start_ms": 288470,
      "end_ms": 288965,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00143",
      "start_ms": 289450,
      "end_ms": 290665,
      "text": "这还真没法比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00144",
      "start_ms": 291170,
      "end_ms": 293725,
      "text": "我妈做的是我从小吃到大的家的味道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00145",
      "start_ms": 294360,
      "end_ms": 297300,
      "text": "您今天这一桌是知道我要来特意准备的心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00146",
      "start_ms": 297780,
      "end_ms": 298920,
      "text": "一个是家的味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00147",
      "start_ms": 298940,
      "end_ms": 299980,
      "text": "一个是您的心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00148",
      "start_ms": 300200,
      "end_ms": 301540,
      "text": "这哪能放在一起比啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00149",
      "start_ms": 304240,
      "end_ms": 305980,
      "text": "你这姑娘还挺会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00150",
      "start_ms": 306160,
      "end_ms": 306860,
      "text": "不过阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00151",
      "start_ms": 307140,
      "end_ms": 308660,
      "text": "您可别再给我夹菜了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00152",
      "start_ms": 309180,
      "end_ms": 310700,
      "text": "怎么不好吃？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00153",
      "start_ms": 311500,
      "end_ms": 312260,
      "text": "哪能啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00154",
      "start_ms": 312780,
      "end_ms": 314640,
      "text": "我是怕第一次来就吃三碗米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00155",
      "start_ms": 315080,
      "end_ms": 318500,
      "text": "下次您听说我要来还得提前多买两斤米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00156",
      "start_ms": 318500,
      "end_ms": 322560,
      "text": "还吃是福，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00157",
      "start_ms": 322560,
      "end_ms": 324850,
      "text": "多吃点儿小苏啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00158",
      "start_ms": 325590,
      "end_ms": 326710,
      "text": "阿姨随口问问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00159",
      "start_ms": 326710,
      "end_ms": 327410,
      "text": "你别多心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00160",
      "start_ms": 327950,
      "end_ms": 329750,
      "text": "以后要是你跟陈默真组了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00161",
      "start_ms": 329750,
      "end_ms": 332015,
      "text": "家庭在你们家谁说了算啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00162",
      "start_ms": 334570,
      "end_ms": 336230,
      "text": "阿姨真成家了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00163",
      "start_ms": 336410,
      "end_ms": 336790,
      "text": "大事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00164",
      "start_ms": 336790,
      "end_ms": 337570,
      "text": "我肯定多听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00165",
      "start_ms": 337570,
      "end_ms": 339590,
      "text": "沉默的陈梦在外面有担当，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00166",
      "start_ms": 339610,
      "end_ms": 340530,
      "text": "眼光宽大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00167",
      "start_ms": 340530,
      "end_ms": 340890,
      "text": "方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00168",
      "start_ms": 340890,
      "end_ms": 341310,
      "text": "她把关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00169",
      "start_ms": 341310,
      "end_ms": 341850,
      "text": "我放心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00170",
      "start_ms": 342190,
      "end_ms": 343250,
      "text": "平时柴米油盐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00171",
      "start_ms": 343250,
      "end_ms": 345070,
      "text": "人情往来的琐事就由我来操心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00172",
      "start_ms": 345230,
      "end_ms": 345970,
      "text": "省得她分心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00173",
      "start_ms": 346470,
      "end_ms": 347110,
      "text": "但其实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00174",
      "start_ms": 347130,
      "end_ms": 348490,
      "text": "不管表面听谁的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00175",
      "start_ms": 348770,
      "end_ms": 349930,
      "text": "只要心往一处使，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00176",
      "start_ms": 350310,
      "end_ms": 351710,
      "text": "把日子过敞亮了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00177",
      "start_ms": 351830,
      "end_ms": 353090,
      "text": "谁当家不都一样吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00178",
      "start_ms": 353510,
      "end_ms": 355455,
      "text": "那阿姨再问你最后一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00179",
      "start_ms": 356110,
      "end_ms": 358885,
      "text": "要是以后我和你之间有了分歧矛盾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00180",
      "start_ms": 359260,
      "end_ms": 360505,
      "text": "你希望沉默帮谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00181",
      "start_ms": 363810,
      "end_ms": 364185,
      "text": "妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00182",
      "start_ms": 364690,
      "end_ms": 367265,
      "text": "哪有第一次来家里问这个的阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00183",
      "start_ms": 367690,
      "end_ms": 368885,
      "text": "真要是有不同意见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00184",
      "start_ms": 369140,
      "end_ms": 370965,
      "text": "那肯定得是沉默先帮着您啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00185",
      "start_ms": 374190,
      "end_ms": 378485,
      "text": "您是长辈几十年的生活阅历在那儿真有分歧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00186",
      "start_ms": 378890,
      "end_ms": 381145,
      "text": "多半是我年轻考虑的不够周全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00187",
      "start_ms": 381640,
      "end_ms": 382265,
      "text": "再说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00188",
      "start_ms": 382540,
      "end_ms": 383380,
      "text": "沉默要是连生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00189",
      "start_ms": 383380,
      "end_ms": 385270,
      "text": "他养他的亲妈都不护着我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00190",
      "start_ms": 385270,
      "end_ms": 387305,
      "text": "哪敢把自己的后半辈子放心交给他呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00191",
      "start_ms": 387610,
      "end_ms": 388010,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00192",
      "start_ms": 388640,
      "end_ms": 389900,
      "text": "这姑娘真是心善，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00193",
      "start_ms": 389920,
      "end_ms": 390560,
      "text": "懂事儿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00194",
      "start_ms": 390560,
      "end_ms": 392035,
      "text": "让人心疼沉默。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00195",
      "start_ms": 392310,
      "end_ms": 393565,
      "text": "你听听人家这格局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00196",
      "start_ms": 393870,
      "end_ms": 394150,
      "text": "以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00197",
      "start_ms": 394150,
      "end_ms": 395190,
      "text": "你要是敢欺负小苏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00198",
      "start_ms": 395270,
      "end_ms": 396190,
      "text": "我第一个饶不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00199",
      "start_ms": 396190,
      "end_ms": 403850,
      "text": "你快放下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00200",
      "start_ms": 403850,
      "end_ms": 404335,
      "text": "快放下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00201",
      "start_ms": 404640,
      "end_ms": 405845,
      "text": "第一次来是贵客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00202",
      "start_ms": 406180,
      "end_ms": 407245,
      "text": "哪能让你洗碗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00203",
      "start_ms": 408050,
      "end_ms": 408410,
      "text": "那行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00204",
      "start_ms": 408410,
      "end_ms": 408815,
      "text": "阿姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00205",
      "start_ms": 409350,
      "end_ms": 410350,
      "text": "今天第一趟来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00206",
      "start_ms": 410590,
      "end_ms": 412255,
      "text": "我绝对服从长辈安排，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00207",
      "start_ms": 412570,
      "end_ms": 414275,
      "text": "今天我负责常阿姨的大餐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00208",
      "start_ms": 414600,
      "end_ms": 414960,
      "text": "等以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00209",
      "start_ms": 414960,
      "end_ms": 416180,
      "text": "我和陈默长回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00210",
      "start_ms": 416260,
      "end_ms": 419060,
      "text": "厨房里的油烟杂活全都交给我们俩您啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00211",
      "start_ms": 419060,
      "end_ms": 421515,
      "text": "就踏踏实实坐沙发上看电视享清福。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00212",
      "start_ms": 421920,
      "end_ms": 424950,
      "text": "哈哈哈呵好有你这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00213",
      "start_ms": 425170,
      "end_ms": 428260,
      "text": "阿姨心里比吃了蜜还甜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00214",
      "start_ms": 428990,
      "end_ms": 431330,
      "text": "以后每个周末都跟陈默回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00215",
      "start_ms": 431510,
      "end_ms": 433525,
      "text": "阿姨随时给你做爱吃的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00216",
      "start_ms": 435980,
      "end_ms": 437225,
      "text": "我现在是真服你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00217",
      "start_ms": 438650,
      "end_ms": 439175,
      "text": "怎么啦？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00218",
      "start_ms": 439970,
      "end_ms": 441905,
      "text": "我妈一进门提到彩礼和房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00219",
      "start_ms": 442200,
      "end_ms": 443615,
      "text": "一句话就把他说高兴了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00220",
      "start_ms": 444290,
      "end_ms": 444990,
      "text": "吃饭的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00221",
      "start_ms": 444990,
      "end_ms": 445690,
      "text": "他说做饭没，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00222",
      "start_ms": 445690,
      "end_ms": 446505,
      "text": "你妈妈好吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00223",
      "start_ms": 446940,
      "end_ms": 447420,
      "text": "换成我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00224",
      "start_ms": 447420,
      "end_ms": 448425,
      "text": "我都不知道怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00225",
      "start_ms": 448700,
      "end_ms": 450580,
      "text": "后面又问你结婚以后谁说了算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00226",
      "start_ms": 450900,
      "end_ms": 452160,
      "text": "还问他跟你闹矛盾了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00227",
      "start_ms": 452160,
      "end_ms": 452995,
      "text": "我应该帮谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00228",
      "start_ms": 453580,
      "end_ms": 455485,
      "text": "我坐旁边听着都替你紧张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00229",
      "start_ms": 458210,
      "end_ms": 459475,
      "text": "你到底是怎么练的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00230",
      "start_ms": 460440,
      "end_ms": 462100,
      "text": "为什么别人突然给你一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00231",
      "start_ms": 462100,
      "end_ms": 463515,
      "text": "你马上就知道该怎么接？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00232",
      "start_ms": 463910,
      "end_ms": 465425,
      "text": "其实我以前跟你一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00233",
      "start_ms": 465970,
      "end_ms": 466795,
      "text": "不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00234",
      "start_ms": 467270,
      "end_ms": 468585,
      "text": "也不知道怎么组织语言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00235",
      "start_ms": 469010,
      "end_ms": 471125,
      "text": "一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00236",
      "start_ms": 472160,
      "end_ms": 475455,
      "text": "后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00237",
      "start_ms": 475870,
      "end_ms": 477210,
      "text": "它里面就是一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00238",
      "start_ms": 477210,
      "end_ms": 478575,
      "text": "一个场景的告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00239",
      "start_ms": 478930,
      "end_ms": 481555,
      "text": "遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00240",
      "start_ms": 482590,
      "end_ms": 484155,
      "text": "比如别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00241",
      "start_ms": 484450,
      "end_ms": 485225,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00242",
      "start_ms": 485810,
      "end_ms": 487170,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00243",
      "start_ms": 487170,
      "end_ms": 488535,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00244",
      "start_ms": 488810,
      "end_ms": 490090,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00245",
      "start_ms": 490170,
      "end_ms": 491750,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00246",
      "start_ms": 491890,
      "end_ms": 492870,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00247",
      "start_ms": 492870,
      "end_ms": 495100,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00248",
      "start_ms": 495100,
      "end_ms": 495685,
      "text": "辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00249",
      "start_ms": 495900,
      "end_ms": 496885,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00250",
      "start_ms": 497240,
      "end_ms": 498555,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00251",
      "start_ms": 498890,
      "end_ms": 500130,
      "text": "强将手下无弱兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00252",
      "start_ms": 500270,
      "end_ms": 501710,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00253",
      "start_ms": 501810,
      "end_ms": 503545,
      "text": "难怪你每次都能接的这么快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00254",
      "start_ms": 504170,
      "end_ms": 505715,
      "text": "这种东西不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00255",
      "start_ms": 506290,
      "end_ms": 507710,
      "text": "就是平时一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00256",
      "start_ms": 507710,
      "end_ms": 508230,
      "text": "个场景的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00257",
      "start_ms": 508230,
      "end_ms": 509470,
      "text": "看一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00258",
      "start_ms": 509470,
      "end_ms": 510315,
      "text": "一个场景的练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00259",
      "start_ms": 511010,
      "end_ms": 511985,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00260",
      "start_ms": 512390,
      "end_ms": 514630,
      "text": "慢慢积累一些不同场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00261",
      "start_ms": 514770,
      "end_ms": 515450,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00262",
      "start_ms": 515850,
      "end_ms": 517975,
      "text": "这里面还有很多生活里的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00263",
      "start_ms": 518310,
      "end_ms": 519390,
      "text": "比如对象给你发红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00264",
      "start_ms": 519390,
      "end_ms": 522365,
      "text": "你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00265",
      "start_ms": 522920,
      "end_ms": 523880,
      "text": "同事向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00266",
      "start_ms": 523980,
      "end_ms": 524855,
      "text": "你又不想借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00267",
      "start_ms": 525220,
      "end_ms": 525775,
      "text": "可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00268",
      "start_ms": 526460,
      "end_ms": 527715,
      "text": "大家都是一样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00269",
      "start_ms": 528070,
      "end_ms": 528755,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00270",
      "start_ms": 528980,
      "end_ms": 529660,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00271",
      "start_ms": 529840,
      "end_ms": 532055,
      "text": "还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00272",
      "start_ms": 532290,
      "end_ms": 533890,
      "text": "你可以回随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00273",
      "start_ms": 534070,
      "end_ms": 535225,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00274",
      "start_ms": 535510,
      "end_ms": 536425,
      "text": "目前不收费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00275",
      "start_ms": 536760,
      "end_ms": 537030,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00276",
      "start_ms": 537070,
      "end_ms": 538715,
      "text": "哈呵这个有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00277",
      "start_ms": 539010,
      "end_ms": 540390,
      "text": "我第一次读到这些的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00278",
      "start_ms": 540390,
      "end_ms": 541955,
      "text": "也有种豁然开朗的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00279",
      "start_ms": 542350,
      "end_ms": 546190,
      "text": "这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00280",
      "start_ms": 546250,
      "end_ms": 547695,
      "text": "一个一个拆开给你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00281",
      "start_ms": 548120,
      "end_ms": 548880,
      "text": "别人怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00282",
      "start_ms": 549020,
      "end_ms": 549820,
      "text": "你可以怎么接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00283",
      "start_ms": 550060,
      "end_ms": 551395,
      "text": "都是一句一句给你举例。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00284",
      "start_ms": 552150,
      "end_ms": 554295,
      "text": "所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00285",
      "start_ms": 554710,
      "end_ms": 556430,
      "text": "每天不用看很多看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00286",
      "start_ms": 556430,
      "end_ms": 559580,
      "text": "碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00287",
      "start_ms": 559700,
      "end_ms": 561605,
      "text": "工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00288",
      "start_ms": 561800,
      "end_ms": 562785,
      "text": "你就知道怎么接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00289",
      "start_ms": 563130,
      "end_ms": 563590,
      "text": "这本先借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00290",
      "start_ms": 563590,
      "end_ms": 565750,
      "text": "我看看拿去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_77dd58c635bcd9ad_s00291",
      "start_ms": 565770,
      "end_ms": 566545,
      "text": "回去慢慢看。"
    }
  ],
